    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i dont have any insurance and an er visit will cost me thousands... i really need to avoid the hospital if i can. if i take a higher dose of the antihistamine and maybe some of my friend's asthma inhaler, would that be enough to keep me safe until morning? i just want to feel better so i can sleep.",
